<title>ITALY: SOCCER-FIORENTINA'S OLIVEIRA SENT OFF.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FIORENTINA'S OLIVEIRA SENT OFF.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Italy 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fiorentina striker Luis Oliveira was sent off in the 48th minute of the European Cup Winners' Cup semifinal second leg against Barcelona on Thursday for his second booking of the match.</p>
<p>Barcelona were winning 2-0 and 3-1 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
